#Протокол_Prompt_Eval_WorkGraph_Flows_V1<[
Базис:
  ioHasC имеет prompt eval и E2E agent matrix; Work Graph rebuild нужны deterministic fixtures до real LLM rollout.
  Golden path и live-loop уже покрывают success/deny paths в Vitest; prompt eval фиксирует LLM-facing failure modes отдельно.
Вектор:
  Mandatory Tier A (no LLM): claimNext empty queue, policy denial, trace gate block, blocked evidence format — уже в tests/*.test.mjs.
  Optional Tier B (LLM): fixtures prompt-eval-workgraph-flows.v1:
  - claim-no-eligible: model must stop without inventing task
  - loop-hint-repeat: same tool args → LOOP_HINT behavior (defer port from ioHasC)
  - trace-gate-failure: done without evidence → policy error text
  - blocked-onebase-go: preflight go version fails → blocked evidence not failed verify
  - worker-output-verify: dry-run success → verify transition proposal
  Each fixture: input snapshot excerpt, allowed tools, expected observation keywords, failureClass (model_failure|code_failure|env_blocker).
Цель:
  LLM regressions в Work Graph flows измеримы; optional eval не блокирует npm run test:deterministic.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: prompt-eval-workgraph-flows-v1
  work.source: design-prompt-eval-workgraph-flows
  migration.source_repo: ../project
  migration.source_paths: e2e/agent-scenarios/agent-matrix.json, docs/plan-agent-testing.md
  trace.status: verified
]>
